<section id="S4.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.4 </span>Ablation Studies</h3>

<div id="S4.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We ablate four design choices on GraphScan-Mamba-T with all training settings inherited from Sec. <a href="#S4.SS1" title="4.1 Image Classification on ImageNet-1K ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Can Graphs Help Vision SSMs See Better?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>: pre- vs. post-SSM placement of the routing operator, graph radius schedule, the relative-position bias <math id="S4.SS4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{\mathrm{rel}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>rel</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{\mathrm{rel}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the number of affinity heads. Each ablation modifies a single factor while holding the rest at their default; the default configuration is marked with <math id="S4.SS4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\star" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⋆</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\star</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T5" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span><span id="S4.T5.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation studies</span> on GraphScan-Mamba-T (training settings identical to Sec. <a href="#S4.SS1" title="4.1 Image Classification on ImageNet-1K ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Can Graphs Help Vision SSMs See Better?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>). Default configuration marked with <math id="S4.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\star" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⋆</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\star</annotation></semantics></math>. Top-1 (%) reported.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
