<p id="S4.T5.9.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S4.T5.9.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(b) </span><span id="S4.T5.9.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Radius schedule</span></p>
